- The lid is loose, so lifting before the far-side arm clamps the lid to the rim could make it slide or fall; every lift requires `lid-secured`.

```python
def constraints(api):
    for action_name in ("lift-one", "lift-two"):
        for _, _, t, action in api.actions(name=action_name):
            api.add(Implies(action, api.holds("lid-secured", t=t)))
```
